{"id":"n72484-1-20","stage":1,"title":"아주 · 非常","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72484-1-20-1","ko":"너희 집은 어디니?","zh":"你们家在哪儿？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你（们）的","explanation":"너희 指包括听者在内的人；与 집 连用时可对一个人说“你家”。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"2","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"집은","meaning":"家、住处","explanation":"집：人居住的地方；-은 标记话题，这里询问住址。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집은","audio":"/audio/4f9292df3492ba091440.mp3"}},{"text":"어디니?","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디니","audio":"/audio/1c8cf4b80ef8a9f9438c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们、你们的","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指包括听者在内的一群人；“너희 집”在本句表示你家。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家、住处","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"人居住的房屋；本句问对方家在哪里。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7f40e86c93003ebe939.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72484-1-20-2","ko":"여기서 아주 가까워. 저 모퉁이만 돌면 바로 우리 집이야.","zh":"离这儿很近哦。只要转过那个拐角，就是我们家了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기서","audio":"/audio/507960116aed3699ca8f.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"가까워.","meaning":"近","explanation":"가깝다：距离近；这里指离此处不远，而非时间近。","readings":[{"term":"가깝다","audio":"/audio/9ff63e71387c2c60a305.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65200","senseId":"1","lemma":"가깝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가까워","audio":"/audio/40436283ff3e983797b8.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"모퉁이만","meaning":"转角，拐角","explanation":"모퉁이：转角，拐角；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"모퉁이","audio":"/audio/9436efc2c3513615fd9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16148","senseId":"1","lemma":"모퉁이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모퉁이만","audio":"/audio/5ec1f808ac590b727ff4.mp3"}},{"text":"돌면","meaning":"转，拐","explanation":"돌다：转，拐；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"돌다","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75006","senseId":"19","lemma":"돌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌면","audio":"/audio/e3e59e28da73de92c5b2.mp3"}},{"text":"바로","meaning":"就","explanation":"바로：就。","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"7","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"ter